    },
    {
      "text": "County HAA findings letter (Nov 13, 2026) names the applicant as San Mateo Housing Group LLC and dates the formal application July 14, 2026; the county project page lists the formal application as received July 16, 2026. The April 28, 2026 preliminary letter is addressed to Belmont Housing Group and describes a 135-unit building.",
