        "SRC-002794",
        "SRC-001159",
        "SRC-002796"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "County findings state the July 14, 2026 application was incomplete because it lacked items on the county Planning Permit Application Form checklist, including a Grading Permit application. The county received no comments on the applicant's HAA notice.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002794"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The formal plan set titles the project San Mateo Pointe.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002795"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "County preliminary letter (Apr 28, 2026) states the parcel is in the County's Rural Area with an Open Space designation and that the project as proposed does not comply with General Plan water supply and wastewater policies.",
